== Trivia ==
* [[anti:Mom's Bracelet|Mom's Bracelet]] originated from the ''Antibirth'' mod.
* The item's design and mechanics are a direct reference to the Power Bracelet from the "Legend of Zelda" series.
* This item is used in {{chal|Isaac's Awakening}}.
* This item can be found as one of the Nintendo-themed {{r|Treasure Room}} items in the 6th of December's [[List of curated daily challenges|Daily Run]], which is an homage to the late CEO of Nintendo, Satoru Iwata.

